   "patch": "@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@\n * Added type annotations for public API and `py.typed` marker (PEP 561)\n * Added `message` to `JsonSchemaValuesException` joining messages of all collected errors\n * Fixed the `date-time` format accepting months, days and hours out of range (such as `2020-19-39T29:00:00Z`) and rejecting a leap second (`23:59:60Z`)\n+* Fixed the `date` and `date-time` formats accepting days that do not exist in their month, such as `2021-02-29` and `2021-04-31`\n * Fixed the `time` format accepting hours, minutes, seconds and offsets out of range (such as `29:99:99`)\n \n === 2.22.2 (2026-08-15)"
